{"id":"pflege","lemma":"Pflege","pos":"noun","rank":4795,"glosses":["care","fostering (of a child)","maintenance (i. e. of a machine)"],"ipa":"/ˈpfleːɡə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/ba/De-Pflege.ogg/De-Pflege.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Pflege"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich pflege seit zehn Jahren Umgang mit ihm.","en":"I have been associated with him for ten years.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"since"},{"g":"ten"},{"g":"year","l":"Jahr"},{"g":"dealings, intercourse"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) him","l":"er"}]},{"text":"Sie benötigen eine tägliche Pflege.","en":"They need daily care.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to need, to require"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"every day, quotidianly","l":"täglich"},null]},{"text":"Tom benötigt ständige Pflege.","en":"Tom requires constant care.","words":[null,{"g":"to need, to require","l":"benötigen"},{"g":"permanent, constant","l":"ständig"},null]},{"text":"Die blinde Krankenschwester widmete sich der Pflege der Älteren.","en":"The blind nurse devoted herself to caring for the elderly.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"blind","l":"blind"},{"g":"nurse"},{"g":"to dedicate, to devote","l":"widmen"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"old","l":"alt"}]},{"text":"Ich pflege des Abends immer einen Spaziergang um den nahegelegenen Teich zu unternehmen.","en":"I make it a rule to take a walk around the nearby pond in the evening.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"of the","l":"der"},{"g":"in the evening"},{"g":"at all times without…"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},{"g":"walk"},{"g":"around / at"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"pond"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to undertake"}]}]}